  (mirror of https://gitlab.com/kholdfuzion/goldeneye_src)

Pinned commit (100% matching, 2026-08-17, message "james bond will return."):

  c4356466796c697dfd298010b9bed261f9ed8c6a

That tree is a matching C decompilation of GoldenEye 007 (N64, 1997).
n64decomp/007 publishes no license we can relicense from. Vendored
