4. What this repo never contains
--------------------------------

- Nintendo 64 ROM images (.z64 / .n64 / .v64)
- Extracted game assets (textures, models, audio, levels, text)
- Links to ROM downloads

Players must supply their own legally obtained NTSC-U dump. Requiring a
user ROM does not make redistributing a compiled engine lawful. See
docs/legal-posture.md.


