6. Native bring-up ROM DMA (K18)
--------------------------------

`silveriris_bringup` is compiled with `PORT_BRINGUP_ROM_DMA`. It may fopen a
developer-supplied local NTSC-U `.z64` and DMA from decomp `filelist.u.csv`
offsets so title / `lvlStageLoad` can be brought up before the pack reader
exists. That fopen is an explicit, flagged exception.

`silveriris` and `game.wasm` are compiled **without** that flag and must not
fopen a ROM. Product play loads a `.c0pack` only (`port_init` / `--pack`).
`tools/pack/extract --rom` is a developer tool, not the product binary.
Neither native binary is a public download. Do not add `fopen("*.z64")` under
`#ifndef PORT_BRINGUP_ROM_DMA`.
